  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Youth Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/90/Steve_the_Wraith_%28Stargate%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130509151313\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Steve the Wraith (Stargate)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/90/Steve_the_Wraith_%28Stargate%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20130509151313\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/90/Steve_the_Wraith_%28Stargate%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20130509151313 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/90/Steve_the_Wraith_%28Stargate%29.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130509151313 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Steve the Wraith (Stargate)\" width=\"270\" height=\"239\" data-image-key=\"Steve_the_Wraith_%28Stargate%29.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Steve the Wraith (Stargate).jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Wraith (Stargate Atlantis)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb Youth.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb the youth of others and utilize it in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Youth_Manipulation\" title=\"Youth Manipulation\">Youth Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Age_Transferal\" title=\"Age Transferal\">Age Transferal</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYouth_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Youth Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYouth_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb the youth of others, removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p><p>Most common applications is to <a href=\"/wiki/Age_Reversal\" title=\"Age Reversal\">reverse</a> their age to a more youthful appearance and <a href=\"/wiki/Decelerated_Aging\" title=\"Decelerated Aging\">slow</a> aging.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYouth_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Affinity\">Affinity</a></li>\n<li>Self-<a href=\"/wiki/Age_Reversal\" title=\"Age Reversal\">Age Reversal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Decelerated_Aging\" title=\"Decelerated Aging\">Decelerated Aging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Condition\">Supernatural Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Age-Based_Powers\" title=\"Category:Age-Based Powers\">Age Based Powers</a>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYouth_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Youthful_Empowerment\" title=\"Youthful Empowerment\">Youthful Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Age_Manipulation\" title=\"Age Manipulation\">Age Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Age_Transferal\" title=\"Age Transferal\">Age Transferal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Thievery\" title=\"Beauty Thievery\">Beauty Thievery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Time_Theft\" title=\"Time Theft\">Time Theft</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYouth_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYouth_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Medlock (<i>Archie's Weird Mysteries</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Morgaine_le_Fey_(New_Earth)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Morgaine le Fey (New Earth)\">Morgan le Fay</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Demon Mice (<i>Dog Days</i>)</li>\n<li>Torina (<i>Fablehaven series</i>)</li>\n<li>Winifred, Mary and Sarah Sanderson (<i>Hocus Pocus</i>); via life potion</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Four_Sorcerers\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Four Sorcerers\">Four Sorcerers</a> (<i>Karsearin: Adventures of a Red Dragon</i>); via <a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Drain_Magic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Drain Magic\">Drain Magic</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Raedi_Yel_Gastria\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Raedi Yel Gastria\">Raedi Yel Gastria</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Psyche_Charles\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Psyche Charles\">Psyche Charles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Sez_Hetris\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Sez Hetris\">Sez Hetris</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://karsearin.fandom.com/wiki/Lucy_Ferlein\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:karsearin:Lucy Ferlein\">Lucy Ferlein</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Somnambula (<i>My Little Pony 'n Friends</i>)</li>\n<li>Charlotte \"Big Mom\" Linlin (<i>One Piece</i>)</li>\n<li>Wraith (<i>Stargate Atlantis</i>)</li>\n<li>Pamela Dare (<i>Superboy</i>)</li>\n<li>Mad Mod (<i>Teen Titans Go!</i>)</li>\n<li>John Smith (<i>Totally Spies</i>); via Jewels of Sumatra</li>\n<li>Kraggler (<i>Yin Yang Yo!</i>)</li>\n<li>Hourglass (Superhero Movie)</li>\n<li>Alien X (<i>Magical Girl Club Quartet</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYouth_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"544d85a18c5b59f6a0d51697d3277f7f\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Medlock_absorb_Scarlet-s_life_force-png\" style